## Phase 0: Technical Debt — Critical Security Fix

- [ ] **Task 0.1**: Fix API authentication vulnerability. Add `auth:sanctum` middleware to `POST /api/attendance/auto` in `routes/api.php`. Currently this endpoint has NO authentication — anyone can POST fake attendance records. Also add auth to `PUT /api/admin/settings`. Update the user dashboard's `cameraHandler()` in `resources/views/dashboard.blade.php` to include Sanctum token or CSRF token in the API request headers. Test that authenticated requests still work and unauthenticated requests get 401.

- [ ] **Task 0.2**: Fix font inconsistency. `tailwind.config.js` declares `fontFamily.sans: ['Figtree']` but `resources/views/layouts/admin.blade.php` and `resources/views/layouts/absensi.blade.php` load `Plus Jakarta Sans` via Google Fonts CDN. Update `tailwind.config.js` to use `'Plus Jakarta Sans'` as the primary sans font. Remove Figtree references. Ensure all layouts consistently use the same font.

